Z||000013||rockcrawl||11-01-2000||04:11 PM|||| 2xsess is right, I sold the Countach and I'm working on the Ferrari spyder now. I'm very proud to say that I did build it myself. I also did the logitude V8 conversion myself. Check my webpage at <A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/lambo.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/lambo.html</A>  for more pics and info. I spent about $12,000 and two years of my spare time to build it, and I sold it for $30,000. D&R replicars can build a turnkey starting at around $28,000 with a V6. Basic kits go from $5000-$12,000(Diablo).<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT (awaiting new engine)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<P>"Confidence is the feeling you have before you fully understand the situation"||||reg||1
